---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Touhou Wiki Portal">
	<div class="portal-outer">
		<h2 class="section-title">東方プロジェクト百科 ~ Touhou Wiki Portal</h2>

		<div class="portal-card">
			<div class="portal-header">
				<h3>Touhou Wiki (東方Wiki)</h3>
				<span class="portal-status">Status: Knowledge Archive</span>
			</div>
			
			<div class="portal-body">
				<p class="portal-desc">
					Touhou Wiki is a collaborative, community-driven database documenting everything related to the Touhou Project franchise. It is the gold standard resource for translations, lore articles, game strategies, CD tracklists, and character details.
				</p>
				<p class="portal-notes">
					<strong>Note from Reimu:</strong> "If you ever get lost in who has what power, or what ZUN-san said in a 2004 interview, this is the place to check. It's almost as detailed as the library in the Scarlet Devil Mansion, but with fewer bats."
				</p>
				
				<div class="portal-link-box">
					<p>Visit the official wiki portal:</p>
					<a href="https://en.touhouwiki.net/wiki/Touhou_Wiki" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-portal-go">
						Go to Touhou Wiki ↗
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="portal-footer">
			<a href="/links" class="btn-back">&lt;&lt; Return to Links Directory</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.portal-outer {
		margin: 1rem 0;
	}

	.portal-card {
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 2px solid var(--reimu-red);
		padding: 1.5rem;
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
	}

	.portal-header {
		border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border-light);
		padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 8px;
	}

	.portal-header h3 {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--reimu-red);
	}

	.portal-status {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: bold;
		background: var(--bg);
		padding: 2px 8px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
	}

	.portal-body {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.portal-desc {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.portal-notes {
		background: var(--bg);
		border-left: 4px solid var(--reimu-red);
		padding: 8px 12px;
		font-style: italic;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.portal-link-box {
		text-align: center;
		border: 1px dashed var(--reimu-red-light);
		padding: 1.25rem;
		background: var(--surface);
	}

	.portal-link-box p {
		margin-bottom: 10px;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--text-dim);
	}

	.btn-portal-go {
		display: inline-block;
		background: var(--reimu-red);
		color: white !important;
		border: 2px outset var(--reimu-red-light);
		padding: 8px 16px;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-weight: bold;
		cursor: url('/cursors/Link.png'), pointer;
		box-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
		transition: all 0.15s ease;
	}

	.btn-portal-go:hover {
		background: var(--magenta);
		border-style: inset;
		text-decoration: none !important;
	}

	.portal-footer {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.btn-back {
		display: inline-block;
		font-weight: bold;
		color: var(--reimu-red);
		border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--reimu-red);
	}
</style>
